{"id":94,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自立と協働で社会に貢献する女子教育","feature_description":"十文字中学校・高等学校は、女子教育の伝統を生かし、学力と人間性をバランスよく育てる学校です。授業、探究、行事、部活動を通して、自ら考え、周囲と協働し、社会に貢献する姿勢を養います。生徒一人ひとりの進路目標に寄り添い、将来に向けて自立して歩む力を育てます。公式サイトの紹介内容をもとに、教育方針や学校生活を整理してまとめています。","clubs":[{"id":1571,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1572,"name":"卓球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1573,"name":"バレーボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1574,"name":"ソフトテニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1575,"name":"バドミントン","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1576,"name":"舞踊","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1577,"name":"体操","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1578,"name":"水泳","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1579,"name":"陸上","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1580,"name":"山岳","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1581,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1582,"name":"バトン","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1583,"name":"硬式テニス","cate